TI  - Addressing Pitfalls in the Evaluation of Uncertainty Estimation Methods for Natural Language Generation
AU  - Mykyta Ielanskyi
AU  - Kajetan Schweighofer
AU  - Lukas Aichberger
AU  - Sepp Hochreiter
