TI  - Alignment through Meta-Weighted Online Sampling: Bridging the Gap between Data Generation and Preference Optimization
AU  - Junming Yang
AU  - Ning Xu
AU  - Biao Liu
AU  - Shiqi Qiao
AU  - Xin Geng
PY  - 2026
