TI  - FlexiVoice: Enabling Flexible Style Control in Zero-Shot TTS with Natural Language Instructions
AU  - DEKUN CHEN
AU  - Xueyao Zhang
AU  - Yuancheng Wang
AU  - Kenan Dai
AU  - Li Ma
AU  - Zhizheng Wu
