TI  - Rating Quality of Diverse Time Series Data by Meta-learning from LLM Judgment
AU  - Shunyu Wu
AU  - Dan Li
AU  - Wenjie Feng
AU  - Haozheng Ye
AU  - Jian Lou
AU  - See-Kiong Ng
